        "name": "Samsite Compliance landing v0.1.0",
        "description": "The basics: one page that exposes every entity the samsite compliance collector lands on the grid — KSI signal, components, validations, violations, VDR report, findings, compliance artifacts — each as a node-table panel. No joins yet; this is the see-the-data-first pass. Detail views via click-through on any row."
      },
      "nodes": [
